# ── EAS Build Archive Ignore ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file reduces the 191MB archive by excluding monorepo workspaces and
# build artifacts that are not needed to compile the native app.
# EAS reinstalls all dependencies on their servers, so node_modules, build
# outputs, and non-native app source are safe to exclude.

# ── Lockfile ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Excluded so EAS runs a plain `bun install` instead of `bun install
# --frozen-lockfile`. EAS Build images ship bun 1.3.8, which cannot read the
# newer lockfile format our local bun (1.3.11) writes — a frozen install fails
# with "lockfile had changes, but lockfile is frozen". Without the lockfile in
# the archive, EAS resolves dependencies fresh from package.json.
bun.lock

# ── Non-native apps ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
apps/web/
apps/server/

# ── DB package (not imported by native) ────────────────────────────────────────
packages/db/generated/
packages/db/node_modules/
packages/db/prisma/migrations/

# ── UI package (native uses its own components, not @pass/ui) ──────────────────
packages/ui/node_modules/
packages/ui/.turbo/

# ── Workspace node_modules (reinstalled on EAS) ─────────────────────────────
node_modules/
apps/native/node_modules/
packages/env/node_modules/
packages/config/node_modules/

# ── Build caches & outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.turbo/
.next/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
.cache/

# ── Dev / editor artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/
